Z||000000||fiero56||06-08-2001||09:17 PM||||Met a guy in the neighborhood today. <P>The wife drives "just a little ol' 525, something to get her and the kids around town in." His daily driver is a beautiful new VR6 GTI. Toy#1 is an '88 M6 in beautiful condition. And toy#2 is a mid 90s(don't remember year)Porsche 911. Both toys are moderatly modified. The GTI is lightly tuned, but is pushing 200hp in a 2600-2700lb car.<P>I hope I have money when I'm in my late 20s with sweet cars...||||reg||1
